 eepest anxieties about gender. What emerges is a fascinating story of dyna
 mic interplay between trans representation on screen\, society’s beliefs
 \, and the reality of trans lives. Reframing familiar scenes and iconic ch
 aracters in a new light\, director Sam Feder \\n\\nMore info: https://chip
