 cipants will discuss the impact of food deserts and how to access to healt
 hy foods in their own communities. Presented in partnership with South Loo
 p Village and The University of Chicago Healthy Aging & Alzheimer's Resear
 ch Care (HAARC\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/events/
 6a02375e3f8e7924031f12b3
